t context when it is likely to improve a response.\",[127],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":128,\"_90\":-7},\"Does ChatGPT search my history for every response?\",[130,131],{\"_77\":91,\"_92\":93,\"_94\":-7,\"_81\":141},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":132},[133,134,135],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":140,\"_90\":-7},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":137,\"_90\":138},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":136,\"_90\":-7},\" is enabled, ChatGPT may also use the account name already shown in the product when that information is relevant.\",\"Reference chat history\",[139],\"b\",\"ChatGPT can remember a name that you provide. When \",[142],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":143,\"_90\":-7},\"Can ChatGPT remember my name or account identity?\",[145,146,147],{\"_77\":91,\"_92\":93,\"_94\":-7,\"_81\":162},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":159},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":148},[149,150,151],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":158,\"_90\":-7},{\"_77\":153,\"_27\":154,\"_81\":155},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":152,\"_90\":-7},\".\",\"a\",\"https://help.openai.com/articles/8096356\",[156],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":157,\"_90\":-7},\"ChatGPT Custom Instructions\",\"For more information about custom instructions, see: \",[160],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":161,\"_90\":-7},\"Yes. Custom instructions are direct guidance that you provide about what ChatGPT should know and how it should respond. Memory can use relevant information that develops across conversations and other available sources.\",[163],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":164,\"_90\":-7},\"Is memory different from custom instructions?\",[166,167],{\"_77\":91,\"_92\":93,\"_94\":-7,\"_81\":171},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":168},[169],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":170,\"_90\":-7},\"No. The summary is a high-level view and may omit details that are less relevant, unsuitable for the summary, or derived from sources that are not displayed individually.\",[172],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":173,\"_90\":-7},\"Does the memory summary include everything ChatGPT remembers?\",[175],{\"_77\":91,\"_92\":176,\"_94\":-7,\"_81\":177},1,[178],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":179,\"_90\":-7},\"FAQ\",[181,182,183,184,185],{\"_77\":91,\"_92\":176,\"_94\":-7,\"_81\":213},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":210},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":198},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":195},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":186},[187,188,189],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":194,\"_90\":-7},{\"_77\":153,\"_27\":190,\"_81\":191},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":152,\"_90\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/7730893\",[192],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":193,\"_90\":-7},\"Data controls in ChatGPT\",\"For more information about data controls, see: \",[196],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":197,\"_90\":-7},\"By default, OpenAI does not use content from ChatGPT Business, Enterprise, Edu, or ChatGPT for Healthcare workspaces to train its models.\",[199,200,201,202,203],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":209,\"_90\":-7},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":207,\"_90\":208},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":206,\"_90\":-7},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":204,\"_90\":205},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":152,\"_90\":-7},\"Data controls\",[139],\" is on. You can turn that setting off in \",\"Improve the model for everyone\",[139],\"For personal ChatGPT accounts, OpenAI may use chats and remembered information to improve models when \",[211],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":212,\"_90\":-7},\"Sensitive information can appear in Memory if you share it with ChatGPT. Review Memory settings and Sources, and choose a non-personalized temporary chat when you do not want the conversation to use or create memories for personalization. If you save the chat, it becomes a regular chat and follows your account’s personalization settings.\",[214],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":215,\"_90\":-7},\"Privacy and model training\",[217,218,219,220,221,222],{\"_77\":91,\"_92\":176,\"_94\":-7,\"_81\":244},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":241},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":238},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":235},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":232},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":223},[224,225,226],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":231,\"_90\":-7},{\"_77\":153,\"_27\":227,\"_81\":228},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":152,\"_90\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/8914046\",[229],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":230,\"_90\":-7},\"Temporary chat in ChatGPT\",\"For more information about temporary chat, see: \",[233],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":234,\"_90\":-7},\"Limited safety-relevant context may be used in rare, high-risk situations. This safety use is separate from Memory personalization.\",[236],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":237,\"_90\":-7},\"Saving a temporary chat converts it to a regular chat. It then follows your account’s personalization and model-improvement settings. If Memory is on, ChatGPT may use the saved conversation to personalize future responses.\",[239],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":240,\"_90\":-7},\"Temporary chats do not create or update memories, even with personalization on. Your account and workspace restrictions still apply.\",[242],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":243,\"_90\":-7},\"Before starting a temporary chat, you can choose whether it uses existing memories, custom instructions, and plugins. Select Unpersonalized if you do not want to use them. You cannot change this choice after the conversation starts.\",[245],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":246,\"_90\":-7},\"Memory in temporary chat\",[248,249,250,251,252,253,254,255],{\"_77\":91,\"_92\":176,\"_94\":-7,\"_81\":289},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":286},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":283},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":280},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":277},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":268},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":265},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":256},[257,258,259],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":264,\"_90\":-7},{\"_77\":153,\"_27\":260,\"_81\":261},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":152,\"_90\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/20001069\",[262],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":263,\"_90\":-7},\"HIPAA Eligible Products and Functionality\",\"For the current list of functionality covered and not covered under the BAA, see: \",[266],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":267,\"_90\":-7},\"Before enabling improved memory, workspace owners and admins should review who will receive access and tell affected members about this restriction. If a memory setting is unavailable in an Enterprise workspace, contact your workspace admin.\",[269,270,271],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":276,\"_90\":-7},{\"_77\":153,\"_27\":272,\"_81\":273},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":152,\"_90\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/10169521\",[274],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":275,\"_90\":-7},\"Projects in ChatGPT\",\"For setup and availability requirements, see: \",[278],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":279,\"_90\":-7},\"Members who choose to use improved memory can use Project-only memory to keep memory context limited to a specific project. Chats can reference other conversations in the same project, but they cannot reference conversations outside the project, and chats outside the project cannot reference conversations in it. Project-only memory changes where context can be referenced; it does not change the BAA guidance in this section.\",[281],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":282,\"_90\":-7},\"This feature is not covered under your BAA. PHI should not be entered when using this feature.\",[284],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":285,\"_90\":-7},\"In ChatGPT for Healthcare and ChatGPT Enterprise with Regulated Workspace, improved memory is disabled by default. Workspace owners and admins can make Use improved memory available to the default workspace role or eligible custom roles.\",[287],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":288,\"_90\":-7},\"Improved memory can use context from past chats to keep its memory current. It is distinct from Memory generally and from the legacy saved memories system.\",[290],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":291,\"_90\":-7},\"Improved memory in regulated workspaces\",[293,294,295,296,297],{\"_77\":91,\"_92\":176,\"_94\":-7,\"_81\":352},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":349},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":346},{\"_77\":301,\"_302\":303},{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":298},[299],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":300,\"_90\":-7},\"Changing the Memory experience does not delete your chat history.\",\"ol\",\"items\",[304,305,306,307],[338],[331],[325],[308],{\"_77\":85,\"_81\":309},[310,311,312,313,314,315,316],{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":324,\"_90\":-7},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":322,\"_90\":323},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":321,\"_90\":-7},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":319,\"_90\":320},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":318,\"_90\":-7},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":26,\"_90\":317},{\"_77\":88,\"_88\":152,\"_90\":-7},[139],\" to return to improv